Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 20:11:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] volumes: apply fsGroup to retained contents

Apply group ownership and access on root mismatch. Preserve private file modes on remount, directory setgid, existing owners and execute bits, and symlink isolation.

Signed-off-by: Weidong Sun <sunweidong@linux.alibaba.com>
Co-authored-by: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
